\fs28 \cf5 \cb15 comptime\cf16  big_int \cf5 =\cf16  \cf5 (\cf14 1\cf16  \cf5 <<\cf16  \cf14 65\cf5 )\cf16  \cf5 +\cf16  \cf14 123456789\cf16   \cf6 # IntLiteral\cf16 \cb1 \
